# The ignore file of .docker/Dockerfile (Docker reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# next to it). `make image` sends `git archive` (only what is committed), so this
# only matters for a plain `docker build -f .docker/Dockerfile .`, which should
# behave the same way.
